Building from the source archive
-------------------------------
Extract zerowave-source.tar.gz and enter zerowave-source/.
With Git, Make, a C compiler, and Python 3 installed, run:

    make bootstrap
    make all

Bootstrap downloads the pinned DASM assembler and py65 test CPU. The build
produces build/atari-zerowave.bin and the release files in dist/.
Use make check to run the ROM tests. Stella is needed to play the ROM, not
to build it. See README.md for controls and other development instructions.

